  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a Social and Inclusive Blue Economy in The Bahamas</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Crear una Economa Azul Social e Inclusiva en las Bahamas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is promoting a more productive and healthier ocean in The Bahamas. The specific objectives are: (i) promoting Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSME) business recovery in the Blue Economy and prospecting investment projects suitable for Blue Bond financing; (ii) promoting digitalization in the Blue Economy; (iii) improving the resilience of the Blue Economy through improved climate risk management in coastal and offshore areas; (iv) promoting better management (certification, traceability and protection) of marine resources; and (v) reducing marine pollution. This project is structured as a Policy-Based Guarantee (PBG).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The general objective is promoting a more productive and healthier ocean in The Bahamas. The specific objectives are: (i) promoting Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSMEs) business recovery in the Blue Economy and prospecting investment projects suitable for blue bond financing;591  5000Resultados de traduccinEl objetivo general es promover un ocano ms productivo y saludable en Las Bahamas. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) promover la recuperacin empresarial de las Micro, Pequeas y Medianas Empresas (MIPYMES) en la Economa Azul y la prospeccin de proyectos de inversin aptos para el financiamiento de bonos azules; (ii) promover la digitalizacin en la Economa Azul; (iii) mejorar la resiliencia de la Economa Azul a travs de una mejor gestin del riesgo climtico en reas costeras y mar adentro; (iv) promover una mejor gestin (certificacin, trazabilidad y proteccin) de los recursos marinos; y (v) reduccin de la contaminacin marina.</narrative>
  </description>
